    "name": "x402 API 🪙🪙🪙",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "x402 v2 on Base USDC. Read PAYMENT-REQUIRED, sign with a compatible wallet, and retry the identical request with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE. Lookup operations cost $0.0495 USDC; List pass purchases have separately documented prices. No API key. No payment is performed by importing this collection.\n\nUpdated 2026-11-10 from https://api.builtwith.com/llms-full.txt. Set KEY locally. Requests are examples; sending data requests may consume credits. Optional query parameters are disabled until selected."
  },
